    "detailed_description": "<strong>GAME CHANGER: ZENITH! </strong><br>Explore a game... as you design it! Team up with the game itself as the line between player and developer blurs. Choose your own genres: Action? Adventure? RPG? Shooter? Tower Defense? Bullet Hell? Easy? Hard? Your game. Your rules. Fire arrows, slash halberds, deploy towers, and upgrade yourself (and the monsters?!) to win your own way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772180/extras/31fe0446b9d56d227dd6c8864e465e2f.poster.avif?t=1711429455\" width=478 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772180/extras/31fe0446b9d56d227dd6c8864e465e2f.webm?t=1711429455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772180/extras/31fe0446b9d56d227dd6c8864e465e2f.mp4?t=1711429455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Play an all-new game... as you design it!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772180/extras/9ef2f6121fc9e4185e08da03797d1ceb.poster.avif?t=1711429455\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772180/extras/9ef2f6121fc9e4185e08da03797d1ceb.webm?t=1711429455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772180/extras/9ef2f6121fc9e4185e08da03797d1ceb.mp4?t=1711429455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Enhance the graphics and battle exciting bosses!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772180/extras/216a06bb8aa9355aa10117